### get office administrator | office administrator

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist?page=1&limit=20&searchTerm=ce ad HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}


### create todolist | office administrator

POST {{baseUrl}}/todolist/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Resolve JWT expiration issue on refresh",
  "title": "Fix login bug"
}


### get todolists | office administrator

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist/all?page=1&limit=20&searchTerm=ce ad HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}


### get todolists | office administrator

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist/all?page=1&limit=20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}


### get todo details | office administrator

# details/:todoId

GET {{baseUrl}}/todolist/details/69de169ecc7e6fef6b5d6ba2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}


### update todo | office administrator

# update/:todoId

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todolist/update/69d4bd4305122ee84934a4bb HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Resolve JWT expiration issue on refresh",
  "isComplete": true,
  "title": "Fix login bug"
}


### update todo image

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todolist/update-image/69de169ecc7e6fef6b5d6ba2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{officeAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "remove",
  "imgUrls": [
    "https://api.zenexcloud.com/emdadullah/uploads/users/todolistImage/1776162461253-d8foeihdxrb.jpeg",
    "https://cdn.example.com/img2.jpg"
  ]
}
